 you even if you don't control a creature.\n• The Ring gains its abilities in order from top to bottom. Once it gains an ability, it has that ability for the rest of the game.\n• Each time the Ring tempts you, you must choose a creature if you control one.\n• Each player can have only one emblem named The Ring and only one Ring-bearer at a time.","cardTypes":[],"colors":[],"colorIdentity":[],"keywords":[],"legalities":{"standard":"not_legal","pioneer":"not_legal","modern":"not_legal","historic":"not_legal","timeless":"not_legal","pauper":"not_legal","commander":"not_legal","brawl":"not_legal","legacy":"not_legal","vintage":"not_legal"},"imageUrl":"https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/7/2/7215460e-8c06-47d0-94e5-d1832d0218af.jpg?1742651318","thumbnailUrl":"https://cards.scryfall.io/small/front/7/2/7215460e-8c06-47d0-94e5-d1832d0218af.jpg?1742651318","power":null,"toughness":null,"isLegendary":false,"canBeCommander":false,"tags":["card_draw","combat_damage_trigger","discard","evasive","sacrifice","unblockable"],"printedNames":["The Ring","The Ring Tempts You"]},{"id":"7e6fb31b-a0ce-4840-926f-85c04b666efa","oracleId":"c5374ea8-169f-427c-b94d-94d0e98431c6","lang":"en","name":"The Rhystic Storyteller","manaValue":3,"typeLine":"Legendary Creature — Human Wizard","oracleText":"If The Rhystic Storyteller is your Commander, your deck can't use sleeves.\nWhenever you cast a spell with ten or more words of flavor text, draw a card unless an opponent pays {1}.","cardTypes":["Creature"],"colors":["U"],"colorIdentity":["U"],"keywords":[],"legalities":{"standard":"not_legal","pioneer":"not_legal","modern":"not_legal","historic":"not_legal","timeless":"not_legal","pauper":"not_legal","commander":"not_legal","brawl":"not_legal","legacy":"not_legal","vintage":"not_legal"},"imageUrl":"https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/7/e/7e6fb31b-a0ce-4840-926f-85c04b666efa.jpg?1775032769","thumbnailUrl":"https://cards.scryfall.io/small/front/7/e/7e6fb31b-a0ce-4840-926f-85c04b666efa.jpg?177503